  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Formulation of new phase of RDPP 2023-2026/7</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to formulate a new phase of the Regional Development and Protection Programme for Lebanon, Jordan and Iraq. The programme will be a multi-donor initiative in line with earlier phase. Dialogue have been initiated with EU and other existing donors and initial support/interest is shown. 

The formulation will be supported by a team of external consultants. A joint venture of HN Consultants ApS and Livelihoods Consult won the tender process.</narrative>
  </description>
